{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261121/photo/bkn-20261121152657809-1121_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261121160524\"/><p>事主倒地昏迷，腳部捲入車底。</p><p>北角發生交通意外。今午(21日)3時15分，一輛私家車由福蔭道轉入宏安道時，意外撞倒一名過路女子。事主的腳部被私家車的右前轆壓住，陷入昏迷，其後要由救援人員救出，再交由救護車送院治療。警員正向涉事司機了解車禍過程，正調查事故成因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:24:12.594543+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:26:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:17:46.179690+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:17:46.179690+00:00","content_hash":"f0f61af67d85940c64962aee93046e93ddbb2886e3a139eea5f7da6e380c6714","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}